    {"offset":7000,"target":"嗯…"},
    {"offset":7027,"target":"我只能依靠"},
    {"offset":7055,"target":"蝼川内先生。"},
    {"offset":7077,"target":"……"},
    {"offset":7106,"target":"只要把钱还上，"},
    {"offset":7130,"target":"我们也能结婚。"},
    {"offset":7156,"target":"我也想和蝼川内先生"},
    {"offset":7208,"target":"结婚…"},
    {"offset":7259,"target":"…啊，对了。"},
    {"offset":7279,"target":"那个…结婚之前，"},
    {"offset":7305,"target":"我想先去拜访"},
    {"offset":7353,"target":"你的父母…"},
    {"offset":7381,"target":"…对不起。"},
